        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    two_year_spot_rate = 0.025\n    four_year_spot_rate = 0.055\n    start_year = 2\n    end_year = 4\n\n    # Calculate the two-year forward rate starting two years from now\n    forward_rate = (\n        ((1 + four_year_spot_rate) ** end_year)\n        / ((1 + two_year_spot_rate) ** start_year)\n    ) ** (1 / (end_year - start_year)) - 1\n\n    # Return the percentage rounded to three decimal places\n    answer = round(forward_rate * 100, 3)\n    return answer\n```",
